  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "Given:\n\n39 * 4 * 61 * 18 * 4 * 49 * 7 * 30\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/13bc0065c96e715682af7c8a6dc1b4c567b7a2a89597cc68809a5ff942c7e421.png] \n\nLet's apply each option on the given equation:\n\nOption 1) + ,− ,= ,× ,− ,+ ,÷\n\n39 + 4 - 61 = 18 × 4 - 49 + __7 ÷ 30__\n\n39 + 4 - 61 = __18 × ____4__ - 49 + 0.2 \n\n__39 + 4__ - 61 = __72__ - 49 __+ 0.2 __\n\n__43 - ____61__ = __72.2 - 49__\n\n-18 ≠ 23.2\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) + ,− ,= ,× ,− ,× ,+\n\n39 + 4 - 61 = __18 × 4__ - __49 × 7__ + 30\n\n__39 + 4__ - 61 = __72__ - 343 __+ 30__\n\n__43 - ____61__ = __10____2__ - 343 \n\n- 18 ≠ - 241\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) × ,− ,= , × ,− ,÷ ,+\n\n39 × 4 - 61 = 18 × 4 - __49 ÷ 7__ + 30\n\n__39 × 4__ - 61 = __18 × 4__ - 7 + 30\n\n156 - 61 = __72__ - 7 __+ 30__\n\n__156 - ____61__ = __102____ - 7__\n\n95 = 95\n\nLHS = RHS\n\nOption 4) = ,− ,+ ,× ,− ,÷ ,−\n\n39 = 4 - 61 + 18 × 4 - __49 ÷ 7__ - 30\n\n39 = 4 - 61 + __18 × ____4__ - 7 - 30\n\n39 = __4__ - 61 __+ 72__ - 7 - 30\n\n39 = __76 - 61 - 7 - 30__\n\n39 ≠ -21\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence the correct answer is \"**× ,− ,= , × ,− ,÷ ,+\"**",
